              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Spearmen have hand weapon and thrusting spear. Spearmen: may have light armour (+2 points) in the form of a leather cape sewn with metal discs, or a large shield (+2 points).</characteristic>
