              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Spearmen have hand weapon and thrusting spear. Spearmen: may have light armour (+2 points) in the form of a leather cape sewn with metal discs, or a large shield (+2 points). Archers have hand weapon and bow. Archers: may have light armour (+2 points). Royal Guard have hand weapon, two-handed weapon and light armour. Royal Guard: may throw sticks (javelins) (+1 point). Nim have hand weapon and javelins. Skirmishers. Chariot Runners.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
